["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Dataset/DatasetAvailabilityType/scrapingScript", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Dataset provider is not making available the underlying data and the dataset shall be reassembled, typically using the provided script for scraping the data.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
